## A group of consecutive simple selectors with no combinator between them, as
## for_each_consecutive_simple_selector_group hands it to its callback (added by region r42): the simple selectors
## (C++ `Vector<SimpleSelector const&>`), the combinator to the group's left and whether it is the rightmost group.
pub struct CssSimpleSelectorGroup:
